哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwil0ICkyNKWAxWaoK8BHV4TM7IQ3YcHCGooAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwil0ICkyNKWAxWaoK8BHV4TM7IQ3IcHCGkoEg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["市場巷子裡的拉麵\n在新北到桃園都有據點\n宵夜好選擇\n價位很平價\n\n📍炙燒肉飯 90元\n上面的美奶滋和碎塊燒肉搭配起來相當美味，不會太過油膩，飯底部也會帶一點肉的醬汁，鹹度剛好，配一些關東煮相當適合。\n\n📍天神拉麵 260元\n些許豆芽和青蔥，叉燒是薄的那種也不會太乾柴，豚骨的味道比較淡，但總體來說鹹度也比較低，麵體細麵偏軟，如果宵夜和簡單吃符合市場口味，偏台式一點。\n\n關東主的醬是胡麻醬，旁邊有擠一點黃芥末醬，蠻提味的，帶一點點嗆感。",null,[0,25]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14324259327917661378/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVvYldOVk1UTlZNazVvWVd4S2JHVkZaSEZOTVZKR1pHdEplR1J0WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6622,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25obWNVMTNVMk5oYWxKbGVFZHFNMVJGZGtJeGRtYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xda55827bc208b58f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnhmcU13U2NhalJleEdqM1RFdkIxdmc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/conten